    "detailed_description": "Pyro Ascension Control Order (P.A.C.O) is the ministry in charge of fire control and safety. You play as a robot that has become faulty, and is deemed unsafe to the public. The robot, called Paco, has been ordered to be incinerated. Paco must utilize the abilities of a Pyro Ascension robot, in order to escape the incineration facility and earn their freedom.<br><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Solve puzzles utilizing Paco's unique gun B.O.U.N.C.E that fires projectiles that shoot Paco and enemies high into the sky</li></ul><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Navigate from the incineration chamber of Robot Corp. all the way up to the CEO's office in order to earn Paco's freedom</li></ul><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Interact with the other robots in the facility, that may choose to aid or hinder Paco, depending on your choices</li></ul><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Discover clues about Robot Corp. and the real reason why Paco was ordered to be destroyed</li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "Pyro Ascension Control Order (P.A.C.O) is the ministry in charge of fire control and safety. You play as a robot that has become faulty, and is deemed unsafe to the public. The robot, called Paco, has been ordered to be incinerated. Paco must utilize the abilities of a Pyro Ascension robot, in order to escape the incineration facility and earn their freedom.<br><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Solve puzzles utilizing Paco's unique gun B.O.U.N.C.E that fires projectiles that shoot Paco and enemies high into the sky</li></ul><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Navigate from the incineration chamber of Robot Corp. all the way up to the CEO's office in order to earn Paco's freedom</li></ul><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Interact with the other robots in the facility, that may choose to aid or hinder Paco, depending on your choices</li></ul><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Discover clues about Robot Corp. and the real reason why Paco was ordered to be destroyed</li></ul>",
    "short_description": "A sci-fi 2D puzzle platformer utilizing an unusual gun, that allows you to navigate a robot incineration facility.",
